resize 600 420
settle 8
key escape
wait-status 600 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 5 messages
wait-status 60 no local sync lanes opened
record-place 13_founder_cold_retained
act Place status
settle 3
capture 13_founder_cold_retained
key escape
act Reconnect place
wait-status 1200 Local rendezvous
act Export place card
settle 3
type ${EXCHANGE}/cold.place-card.json
key enter
wait-file 600 ${EXCHANGE}/cold.place-card.json
touch ${CONTROL}/cold-founder.listening
wait-file 2400 ${CONTROL}/cold-joiner.listening
act Send place message
settle 3
type founder after resident restart
key enter
wait-status 2400 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 7 messages
wait-file 1200 ${CONTROL}/cold-joiner.saved
act Save session
settle 8
act Place status
settle 3
record-place 14_founder_cold_converged
capture 14_founder_cold_converged
